{
  "name": "gw-ws-upgrade-variants",
  "about": "WS 升级请求的各种写法（src/gateway/server/GatewayServer.ts:137-172 handleUpgrade）：路径不是 /ws 或缺 Sec-WebSocket-Key 时直接断开、不回任何字节（145-153）；Upgrade 头的值、方法、Sec-WebSocket-Version 都不检查，带查询串照常升级，请求的子协议不回显（154-163 只回 Accept）；跟升级请求挤在同一段里的 hello 被丢掉（67 不读 upgrade 事件的 head），所以没有 hello_ok；hello 与第一个请求连发（不等 hello_ok）时请求照常应答（GatewayWsConnection.ts:108 在等 describeServer 之前就置 authed）；第二个 hello 关 4002 invalid_frame；request 的 id 不是字符串关 4002 invalid_frame（630-637）；分成两帧的消息（FIN=0 + 续帧）第一段按整条消息解析失败，关 4002 invalid_json。",
  "steps": [
    {
      "raw": {
        "ws": {
          "path": "/wsx"
        },
        "readMs": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "raw": {
        "ws": {
          "headers": {
            "Sec-WebSocket-Key": null
          }
        },
        "readMs": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "raw": {
        "ws": {
          "headers": {
            "Upgrade": "not-websocket"
          }
        },
        "hello": true,
        "readMs": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "raw": {
        "ws": {
          "method": "POST",
          "headers": {
            "Content-Length": "0"
          }
        },
        "hello": true,
        "readMs": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "raw": {
        "ws": {
          "path": "/ws?client=bbx&x=1",
          "headers": {
            "Sec-WebSocket-Version": "8",
            "Sec-WebSocket-Protocol": "chat, superchat",
            "Origin": "http://evil.example"
          }
        },
        "hello": true,
        "readMs": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "raw": {
        "ws": {
          "headers": {
            "Connection": "keep-alive, Upgrade"
          }
        },
        "hello": true,
        "readMs": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "raw": {
        "send": [
          {
            "hex": ""
          }
        ],
        "readMs": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "raw": {
        "ws": true,
        "send": [
          {
            "frame": {
              "opcode": 1,
              "json": {
                "type": "hello",
                "protocolVersion": "1.2",
                "clientName": "test",
                "clientVersion": "0.0.0",
                "token": "{TOKEN}"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "frame": {
              "opcode": 1,
              "json": {
                "type": "request",
                "id": "pipelined-1",
                "method": "describe_server",
                "params": {}
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "readMs": 1500
      }
    },
    {
      "raw": {
        "ws": true,
        "hello": true,
        "send": [
          {
            "frame": {
              "opcode": 1,
              "json": {
                "type": "hello",
                "protocolVersion": "1.2",
                "clientName": "test",
                "clientVersion": "0.0.0",
                "token": "{TOKEN}"
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "readMs": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "raw": {
        "ws": true,
        "hello": true,
        "send": [
          {
            "frame": {
              "opcode": 1,
              "json": {
                "type": "request",
                "id": 7,
                "method": "describe_server",
                "params": {}
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "readMs": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "raw": {
        "ws": true,
        "hello": true,
        "send": [
          {
            "frame": {
              "opcode": 1,
              "fin": false,
              "text": "{\"type\":\"request\","
            }
          },
          {
            "frame": {
              "opcode": 0,
              "text": "\"id\":\"frag-1\",\"method\":\"describe_server\",\"params\":{}}"
            }
          }
        ],
        "readMs": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "raw": {
        "send": [
          {
            "text": "GET /health HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: x\r\nConnection: close\r\n\r\n"
          }
        ],
        "readMs": 1500
      }
    }
  ]
}
